     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\sqrt {1,815}  = \\sqrt {121} \\sqrt {15}  = 11\\sqrt {15} \"></span></p>\n<p>The rational part is 11.</p>\n<p>The irrational part is <span data-math=\"\\sqrt {15} \"></span>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"11\\sqrt {15}\">11\\sqrt {15}</span>. The rational part is 11, and the irrational part is <span data-math=\"\\sqrt {15}\">\\sqrt {15}</span>."
    }
